      "seconds": 3.23,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_004.wav",
      "subtitle": "结束之后我就可以过去了。\n有什么事？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "umiri",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "umiri",
      "speakerId": "adv_umiri",
      "text": "让你们久等了。\n如果你们在忙的话，需要我待会儿再过来吗？",
      "textId": "adv_script_mygo_001_1_16_19",
      "pageUrl": "https://bdon.moe/story/10015",
      "index": 119,
      "url": "https://assets.bdon.moe/zh-Hans/Cri/Sound/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16/adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_017.m4a",
      "cue": "adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_017",
      "sourceType": "story",
      "sha256": "e40989ed433b8cbc44c72c333b040b706f2a41a7aec7baf3f125b509426621c2",
      "nativeSha256": "0f9514d836f981ffcc8c774571d8520eb37009f1a861e6bf518fba8eb3da17e4",
      "bytes": 397332,
      "seconds": 4.504,
      "path": "assets/voices/source_adv_voice_mygo_001_1_16_017.wav",
      "subtitle": "让你们久等了。\n如果你们在忙的话，需要我待会儿再过来吗？"
    },
    {
      "slug": "umiri",
      "provider": "bdon.moe",
      "speaker": "umiri",
      "speakerId": "adv_umiri",
      "text": "……好险。倒是没想到你会把包扔给我呢。\n罢了，反正也不是特别重要的东西",
